{"id":"8f8f1ec72ff6ac85","group":"57","path":"57/57-thm-herbrand-theorem.md","title":"Herbrand's Theorem","display":"thm-herbrand — Herbrand's Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-thm-herbrand-theorem","aliases":["57-thm-herbrand-theorem"],"display":"thm-herbrand — Herbrand's Theorem","depends_on":["[[57-df-herbrand-base]]","[[57-df-herbrand-expansion]]","[[57-df-prop-sat]]","[[57-df-satisfiable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-thm-herbrand-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-thm-herbrand-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-herbrand — Herbrand's Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ac4f07708b58159c\" href=\"?note=ac4f07708b58159c\" title=\"57-df-herbrand-base\">57-df-herbrand-base</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"341dd891eed2b080\" href=\"?note=341dd891eed2b080\" title=\"57-df-herbrand-expansion\">57-df-herbrand-expansion</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"083ea30cb34a396c\" href=\"?note=083ea30cb34a396c\" title=\"57-df-prop-sat\">57-df-prop-sat</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"befcfc958ddf5dbd\" href=\"?note=befcfc958ddf5dbd\" title=\"57-df-satisfiable\">57-df-satisfiable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"Herbrand's-Theorem\">Herbrand's Theorem</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为一阶字母表，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HU}(S)\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(\\mathrm{HU}(S)\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{UnivSent}_S\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{UnivSent}_S\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EqFree}(\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{EqFree}(\\varphi)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UnivSent}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{UnivSent}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EqFree}\">\\(\\mathrm{EqFree}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"341dd891eed2b080\" href=\"?note=341dd891eed2b080\" title=\"57-df-herbrand-expansion\">57-df-herbrand-expansion</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sat}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sat}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PropSat}\">\\(\\mathrm{PropSat}\\)</span> 分别取一阶非空结构满足性和原子任意布尔赋值满足性；基实例无量词且闭合。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{UnivSent}_S\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{UnivSent}_S\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\sigma\\in T\\;\\mathrm{EqFree}(\\sigma)\">\\(\\forall\\sigma\\in T\\;\\mathrm{EqFree}(\\sigma)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\mathrm{Sat}(T)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\Phi\\subseteq E(T)\\;\\bigl(|\\Phi|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land\\neg\\mathrm{PropSat}(\\Phi)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\mathrm{Sat}(T)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\Phi\\subseteq E(T)\\;\\bigl(|\\Phi|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land\\neg\\mathrm{PropSat}(\\Phi)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原式从 B_S 选有限正原子集，无法表达不可满足性；改为从同一理论的基实例 E(T) 选有限集。B_S 的定义不变。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Herbrand's-Theorem","text":"Herbrand's Theorem","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-herbrand-base","status":"resolved","id":"ac4f07708b5